---
import { BaseLayout } from "@ranydev/theme";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About ranydev — an independent software lab by Raymundo Ycaza, building tools and sharing engineering notes."
>
  <header class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted">about</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
      Behind the lab.
    </h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose mt-10 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="lead">
      I'm Raymundo Ycaza — a software developer building under the name
      <strong>ranydev</strong>, an independent software lab focused on tools,
      experiments, and honest engineering notes.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is where I turn ideas into working software and write down what
      the process actually taught me. No growth-hacking, no guru talk — just
      real code and the decisions behind it.
    </p>

    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Design and build web tools end to end.</li>
      <li>Run small, self-contained experiments worth sharing.</li>
      <li>Write engineering notes on what works and what doesn't.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <p>
      Build first, refine later. Prefer clarity over cleverness. Ship something
      useful, then iterate. If it doesn't help someone build or ship, it
      probably isn't worth publishing.
    </p>

    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <p>
      Find me on
      <a
        href="https://github.com/RaymundoYcaza"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank">GitHub</a
      >,
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/raymundoycaza"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank">LinkedIn</a
      >, or watch the build on
      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/@ranydev"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank">YouTube</a
      >. ranydev is part of the
      <a
        href="https://www.raymundoycaza.com"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank">Raymundo Ycaza</a
      > ecosystem.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
